{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/pages/faq.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:09:42.883470Z","id":"ed3d4892f2009f075a9fa51bac313043375a95308123b835689efa561689d8b2","body":{"detail":"crates/toolpath/tests/signatures.rs (signed_step_and_path_verify, tampered_change_fails, moved_head_fails_both_path_signatures, missing_required_scope_fails, gpg_and_sigstore_are_not_verified, scopes_without_a_canonical_form_are_refused) and tests/jcs.rs (RFC 8785 reference vectors), feature 'verify' (810a58b). No harness reader or git import produces signatures (vcs@mapping: gpgsig never reaches meta.signatures) or dead ends.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:810a58b","span":{"start":{"line":20},"end":{"line":20},"content_hash":"4b3bd8bc3a3d463b1b221faad63fd089983db4e038fb71a05399f2e9aa713ac4"},"summary":"FAQ: Toolpath tracks what was tried and how to verify it — verification exists for ssh-signed documents; producers sign nothing and emit no dead ends","supersedes":"e74420447287724a0ac791a054536c4c9d2f8df6d4a4aa52bd59b0bf00f52493","tags":["claim:faq-what-verify","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
